  designNotes: 'Mind''s denial (the user, 2026-10-15): a Watchdog that nullifies
    the next 2 enemy spells that deal damage, Monitored, so it catches ones planned
    before it. Narrower than Antivirus (any spell, 1 charge), so 2 charges: the blow
    lands and doesn''t, and the mind picks doesn''t.'
  artDescription: 'A man calmly sipping tea while a fireball hits him, drawn twice
    over itself like a double exposure: in one he is burnt to a crisp, in the other
    untouched, a thought bubble above him reading YES / NO with both boxes ticked.'
